{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】旺角凌晨有兩輛的士相撞，六人受傷。</p>\n<p>兩輛的士車頭毀爛、零件散落一地，交通燈及鐵欄被撞毀。凌晨一時許，兩輛的士於洗衣街與弼街交界相撞，兩名司機及四名乘客受傷，在現場初步治理後，由救護車送往廣華醫院。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T23:52:48.765927+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T23:05:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:46:20.279918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:46:20.279918+00:00","content_hash":"b6393a35424b62454cd582a345d298b3694e4bc87bfdc38cd2adbc17ff2e4c3d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}